# General agent rules

Full playbook: `/home/ranveer/app/dev-space/docs/AGENT_RULES.md`

New project bootstrap: `/home/ranveer/app/dev-space/docs/NEW_PROJECT.md`

## Workflow

Understand → check what exists → confirm intent → plan → implement → verify.

State assumptions before acting. Ask once, batched, when the answer changes design or scope.

## Always confirm first

Deleting data, schema migrations, prod config, auth/security/trading execution, commits/pushes — unless the user asked in this turn.

## Testing

Add or update tests when behavior changes. Run typecheck/lint/affected tests and report real results.

## Implement narrowly

Reuse existing patterns. Smallest diff. No drive-by refactors.

## Git

Commit only when the user explicitly asks.
